 <section class="tools" id="sscc-overview-tools"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Work out what you need</div><h2>Interactive player tools</h2></div><p>Handy tools for comparing your options and planning your gear.</p></div><div class="toolgrid"><article class="tool"><div class="toolicon">✨</div><div><h3>Runecrafting Hub</h3><p>Explore enchantments, plan your equipment builds, calculate rune costs, and compare options—all in one place.</p><a class="btn" href="/runecrafting-hub/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Runecrafting Hub ↗</a></div></article><article class="tool"><div class="toolicon">🛍️</div><div><h3>Valor Shop Planner</h3><p>Browse the catalog, plan purchases by merchant, and look through Additional Charms in their own reference section.</p><a class="btn secondary" href="#sscc/valor/planner">Open Shopping Planner →</a></div></article></div></section>
 <section id="sscc-overview-more"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Vanilla Plus preview</div><h2>Improvements &amp; Conveniences</h2></div><p>A few more things to make everyday survival a little easier.</p></div><div class="detailgrid"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>🧰 Artifact Trader & material exchanges</summary><p>Prepare materials for custom artifacts, then trade with the villager beneath the lower-level stairs in the Valor Shop. <a style="color:var(--pink2)" href="#sscc/valor/trader">Explore Artifact Trader exchanges →</a></p></details><details><summary>🛡️ Protection & building</summary><p>Find Bolt commands, sharing controls, display tools, armor-stand posing, and creative-world settings. <a style="color:var(--pink2)" href="#sscc/vanilla/protect">Explore protection & access →</a></p></details><details><summary>🌱 Farming, Alchemy & exploration</summary><p>Harvest and replant, brew custom potions, bottle XP, and discover the influence of Luck. <a style="color:var(--pink2)" href="#sscc/vanilla/survival">Explore survival conveniences →</a></p></details><details><summary>⚡ Combat mechanics</summary><p>Learn shield parries and bashes, projectile rules, stuns, trident changes, and PvP exceptions. <a style="color:var(--pink2)" href="#sscc/vanilla/combat">Explore combat mechanics →</a></p></details><details><summary>🐾 Pets & mobs</summary><p>Capture mobs, control companions, and apply permanent mob effects. <a style="color:var(--pink2)" href="#sscc/vanilla/companions">Explore pets & mobs →</a></p></details><details><summary>🎉 Rush Weekends & seasonal events</summary><p>Explore recurring Rush bonuses, Blood Moons, Spooky Springs, Christmas gifts, and build contests. <a style="color:var(--pink2)" href="#sscc/vanilla/events">Explore events & activities →</a></p></details></div><aside class="quick"><h3>Quick in-game commands</h3><p>Useful shortcuts for exploring custom content. Tap Copy to grab a command.</p><div class="command"><span>/warp RuneHub</span><button class="copy" data-copy="/warp RuneHub">Copy</button></div><div class="command"><span>/warp Arcanum</span><button class="copy" data-copy="/warp Arcanum">Copy</button></div><div class="command"><span>/warp ValorShop</span><button class="copy" data-copy="/warp ValorShop">Copy</button></div><div class="command"><span>/warp TrialShop</span><button class="copy" data-copy="/warp TrialShop">Copy</button></div><div class="command"><span>/trialpoints</span><button class="copy" data-copy="/trialpoints">Copy</button></div><p>For Trial participation, use <strong>/trial join</strong> followed by the Trial name.</p><a class="btn secondary" style="margin-top:9px" href="#sscc/vanilla">Browse Vanilla Plus →</a></aside></div></section>
